      <!-- M2-4: the tools that were missing.
           The audit (docs/CODE_AUDIT_2026-10-26.md 5.3) listed them by
           priority: the eraser group, the gradient + paint bucket, the
           dodge / burn, the blur / sharpen / smudge, and the view
           tools (hand / zoom / rotate view).

           The button order does NOT have to match the ToolId values.
           The ToolId is what the ImageOptionBar uses as the page
           index, the button order is only the visual order. -->
