   <!-- P7.1 (2026-10-12): PS-style fg/bg swatch (60x50 stacked).
        Foreground 50x50 + Background 10x50 corner-anchored. Click fg to
        pick color, click bg to pick, click on the small arrow inside fg
        (swap hint) to swap. Default: fg=black, bg=white.
        Layout dropped: all 3 widgets use absolute geometry inside
        fgBgContainer (no Qt layout manager), matching PS visual look. -->
